The Greatest Idol in the World

343
00:56:00,860 --> 00:56:06,140
思い出して 出会った日のことを 手を取って 僕らの旅がはじまった
Remembering the day we met, holding hands as our journey began

344
00:56:10,560 --> 00:56:15,630
走って転んで 涙を流しても 気が付けばほら 顔合わせ笑う
Even if we run, fall, and shed tears, before we know it, we're laughing face to face

345
00:56:20,870 --> 00:56:26,410
喜ぶ声が嬉しくて 夢が溢れ出す ねえ 君がいなきゃだめなんだ
Your joyful voices make me so happy, dreams overflowing—I need you here

346
00:56:31,150 --> 00:56:36,320
今 世界で一番 幸せなアイドルから 世界で一番の笑顔をあげちゃう
Now, from the happiest idol in the world, I'll give you the biggest smile in the world!

347
00:56:43,080 --> 00:56:48,320
僕を見つけてくれた 愛してくれた だから まだまだ終わらない
You found me, you loved me, so it's not over yet

348
00:56:51,810 --> 00:56:56,300
ちゃんとついてきて きらめく夢へ
Follow me closely toward our sparkling dreams...

349
00:57:04,470 --> 00:57:09,510
羽ばたいてゆく 背中を見送った 雨上がり 君の傘を返したら
Watching your back as you flew away, after the rain when I returned your umbrella

350
00:57:15,260 --> 00:57:20,320
手を引いて進もう 一緒にどこまでも 気が付けばほら また前を向ける
Holding hands, let's go anywhere together; before we know it, we're looking forward again

351
00:57:25,060 --> 00:57:31,270
じゃれあう言葉の中にも 愛を感じています 僕じゃなきゃだめなんでしょ？
Feeling love even in our teasing words, I'm the only one for you, right?

352
00:57:37,440 --> 00:57:42,500
今 世界で一番 幸せなアイドルから 世界で一番のときめきをあげちゃう
Now, from the happiest idol in the world, I'll give you the biggest thrill in the world!

353
00:57:48,860 --> 00:57:54,200
僕を支えてくれた 推してくれた だから まだまだ終わらない
You supported me, you cheered for me, so it's not over yet

354
00:57:56,750 --> 00:58:01,600
隣にいてよ
Please stay by my side...

355
00:58:13,760 --> 00:58:18,360
「もうやめよう」って泣いた日もあった
There were days I cried and wanted to quit...

356
00:58:19,040 --> 00:58:23,400
そんなとき浮かんでくるの みんなの声が
At times like those, everyone's voices would come to mind

357
00:58:25,010 --> 00:58:30,810
今までで一番 諦めたくないの ずっとなりたかった 最強のアイドル
More than ever, I don't want to give up on this—the ultimate idol I always wanted to be

358
00:58:40,130 --> 00:58:45,180
今 世界で一番 幸せなアイドルから 世界で一番の大好きをあげちゃう
Now, from the happiest idol in the world, I'll give you all my love!

359
00:58:51,260 --> 00:58:56,750
些細な日常も もっと大きなステージも まだまだ終われない
Even a dull routine and grand stages—my journey isn't over yet

360
00:59:00,810 --> 00:59:05,120
君と結んでく
Weaving it together with you

361
00:59:32,920 --> 00:59:36,710
特者生存ワンダラダー!!
Tokusha Seizon Wonderadarr!!

362
00:59:42,410 --> 00:59:47,760
なぬっ？ ビシッ おりゃっ！ パシッ ツッコミも冴えて 本日快晴
What? Snap! Take this! Slap! My sharp retorts make today crystal clear

363
00:59:50,940 --> 00:59:54,170
必死にがんばろっか それが僕らしいよな
Let's do our absolute best! That's what makes me, me!

364
01:00:00,634 --> 01:00:04,274
ダサすぎ じゃねえんだわ そんで貧乏っちい じゃねえんだわ
It's not like we're uncool, and it's not like we're dead broke...

365
01:00:04,694 --> 01:00:08,234
うん 万事がパッチリ イケてるに決まってる！
Yep, everything's spot-on, we're bound to look awesome!

366
01:00:08,894 --> 01:00:11,074
(Are you?) かなたちゃん
(Are you?) Kanata-chan!

367
01:00:11,554 --> 01:00:13,954
どどん 前進上等 ちゃんと歓迎して
Boom, full steam ahead, welcome it properly!

368
01:00:14,694 --> 01:00:17,214
(Wonder-la-der-la) 高まれ 海空創造 ちゃんと驚嘆して
(Wonder-la-der-la) Soar high, create sea and sky, and marvel at it properly!

369
01:00:17,974 --> 01:00:20,314
(Wonder-la-der-la) 興奮しよう 僕が言うんだもん
(Wonder-la-der-la) Let's get excited, since I say so!

370
01:00:20,494 --> 01:00:23,554
本当にするんだもん 現実超えろ未来 あぁ
We'll really make it happen, surpass reality, future, ah—

371
01:00:28,494 --> 01:00:31,254
弱点も平気 スイッチでランチャー
Weaknesses are fine too, launcher at the flip of a switch!

372
01:00:31,774 --> 01:00:35,634
(Wonder-la-der-la) すなわち特者生存ワンダランダ Day
(Wonder-la-der-la) In other words, Survival of the Smartest Wonder-render Day!

373
01:00:36,234 --> 01:00:41,614
(Wonder-la-der-la) 楽しもう 面白がれること探したまえ over？
(Wonder-la-der-la) Let's enjoy, go look for things you can find amusing, over?

374
01:00:42,094 --> 01:00:45,694
返事聞かせてくれ 右左なんかじゃない
Let me hear your reply, it's not about left or right!

375
01:00:48,654 --> 01:00:52,594
（かなたーん） 決めつけて一直線 （かなたーん） つまり企んだら発射オーライだ
(Kanata-n!) Commit to a straight line (Kanata-n!) meaning once you plot it, launch is all right!

376
01:00:54,994 --> 01:00:56,954
ワクワクすんぜ しゃー！
Getting all excited, yeah!

377
01:01:04,354 --> 01:01:09,434
聞いて！ みんなと離れるのが寂しいのと ガッキーの結婚は立ち直ってません
Listen! Being apart from everyone is sad, and I still haven't gotten over Gakki's marriage!

378
01:01:10,054 --> 01:01:13,574
僕をアイドルにしてくれて みんな本当にありがとう！
Thank you all so much for making me an idol!

379
01:01:14,054 --> 01:01:17,934
何だよそんなこと言っちゃダメだ おばか！
What are you saying such things for, you dummy!

380
01:01:18,214 --> 01:01:22,194
うわ すごい ありがちょ 日々これ騒然で Go my way
Wow, amazing, thanks! Day in, day out, going my way!

381
01:01:22,414 --> 01:01:25,454
虎視眈々でいたいんだもん だって意気ガンガンがいいんだもん
I want to stay vigilant, because I want my fighting spirit raging high!

382
01:01:25,714 --> 01:01:29,914
全方位にがっつりアンテナ張っていなくちゃ！
I've got to keep my antennas fully tuned in all directions!

383
01:01:30,734 --> 01:01:34,534
いつでも心はちゃんと純粋で
Always keeping my heart pure and true...

384
01:01:34,934 --> 01:01:41,174
(Wonder-la-der-la) いたいな 好奇心は絶えず熱心で (Wonder-la-der-la) いたいなって 言い聞かせるんだ
(Wonder-la-der-la) I want to stay, with curiosity constantly earnest (Wonder-la-der-la) I keep telling myself that...

385
01:01:41,434 --> 01:01:44,787
調子に乗ったら すぐ飽きられちゃうから あぁ
If I get carried away, people will get tired of me right away, ah—

386
01:01:45,047 --> 01:01:48,407
タイトなロープもどんとこいでっせ
Even a tight rope is bring-it-on territory!

387
01:01:48,647 --> 01:01:52,647
(Wonder-la-der-la) すなわち特者生存ワンダランダ Day
(Wonder-la-der-la) In other words, Survival of the Smartest Wonder-render Day!

388
01:01:52,887 --> 01:01:58,727
(Wonder-la-der-la) しがみつけ 努力とは最後まで諦めないこと
(Wonder-la-der-la) Hang on tight, effort means never giving up until the very end!

389
01:01:59,047 --> 01:02:03,527
メモっておいて！ ホントは Baby 自信なんかないよ
Make a note of it! Honestly, Baby, I don't have any confidence...

390
01:02:03,807 --> 01:02:07,787
ホントは Baby 不安ばっかで泣きそうだ
Honestly, Baby, I'm so full of anxiety I could cry...

391
01:02:08,067 --> 01:02:13,387
でもね Baby 挫けないって決めたの だだから Baby
But you know, Baby, I decided not to break, so Baby...

392
01:02:13,627 --> 01:02:18,067
挑戦したいよ 未開の天地 無限のフィールドで！
I want to take on the challenge in an uncharted realm, an infinite field!

393
01:02:18,307 --> 01:02:19,807
ギター！
Guitar!

394
01:02:36,954 --> 01:02:40,314
前進上等 ちゃんと歓迎して
Full steam ahead, welcome it properly!

395
01:02:40,734 --> 01:02:44,654
(Wonder-la-der-la) 高まれ 海空創造 ちゃんと驚嘆して
(Wonder-la-der-la) Soar high, create sea and sky, and marvel at it properly!

396
01:02:45,074 --> 01:02:49,034
(Wonder-la-der-la) 興奮しよう ボクが言うんだもん 本当にするんだもん
(Wonder-la-der-la) Let's get excited, since I say so, we'll really make it happen!

397
01:02:49,354 --> 01:02:53,107
現実超えろ未来 あぁ 弱点も平気 スイッチでランチャー
Surpass reality, future, ah— Weaknesses are fine too, launcher at the flip of a switch!

398
01:02:53,367 --> 01:02:57,487
(Wonder-la-der-la) すなわち特者生存ワンダランダ Day
(Wonder-la-der-la) In other words, Survival of the Smartest Wonder-render Day!

399
01:02:57,747 --> 01:03:01,687
(Wonder-la-der-la) 楽しもう 面白がれること探し放題でっせ
(Wonder-la-der-la) Let's enjoy ourselves, with endless things to find amusing!

400
01:03:02,007 --> 01:03:05,227
無限のフィールドで
In an infinite field...

401
01:03:05,447 --> 01:03:08,847
パンニングしなくてもいい （かなたーん） ど真ん中一直線
You don't even have to pan (Kanata-n!) straight down the center!

402
01:03:09,107 --> 01:03:13,067
（かなたーん） つまりこれが僕の答えなんだ 胸を張れ
(Kanata-n!) Meaning this is my answer, puff out your chest!

403
01:03:13,327 --> 01:03:17,207
今を生きるその意味を 明くる日も明くるくる日も 確かめ進め
Puff out your chest, confirm the meaning of living in the present, day after relentless day, and push forward!

404
01:03:17,467 --> 01:03:19,227
うおりゃー！
Urya!

405
01:03:48,560 --> 01:03:56,020
みんな！ありがとうございますた！
Everyone! Thank you so much!

406
01:03:58,600 --> 01:04:05,460
え、聴いていただいたのはオリジナル楽曲、メドレーにしました！繋ぎましたよ！
Um, what you just listened to was a medley of original songs! I stitched them together!

407
01:04:05,840 --> 01:04:09,420
そして「世界で1番のアイドル」作詞をしました
And I wrote the lyrics for "The Number One Idol in the World".

408
01:04:09,420 --> 01:04:14,660
この時卒業なんて考えてなかったから本当に、あのいっぱい聴いてほしい曲です。
At that time, I wasn't thinking about graduation at all, so it's a song I really want you to listen to a lot.

409
01:04:14,860 --> 01:04:18,480
そして「特者生存ワンダラダー!!」でした！はい！これを初めてね、出しましたね。
And that was "Tokusha Seizon Wonderadarr!!" Yes! This is the first time I've performed it live, you know.

410
01:04:18,680 --> 01:04:25,880
え、オリジナル楽曲ですけれどもちょっと語りたいこといっぱいあるんですけど
Uh, it's an original song, and there's a lot I want to talk about, but...

411
01:04:26,720 --> 01:04:30,160
やっぱりあの服だよね？ってことでね
As expected, that outfit, right? So...

412
01:04:30,300 --> 01:04:32,500
1秒着替えしてきましーーた！
I did a 1-second costume changeーー!

413
01:04:33,560 --> 01:04:37,700
はい！やっぱこれだよねみんな！へいこんかなた！
Yes! This is definitely the one, everyone! Hey, Konkanata!

414
01:04:38,120 --> 01:04:46,720
キャッチコピーは握力50kg牛丼握り潰しちゃんさ、ホロライブ4期生天音かなたこたんばねかなたです。はい！
My catchphrase is "grip strength 50kg beef bowl crushing chan," Hololive 4th generation Amane Kanata... Kotanbane... Kanata! Yes!

415
01:04:47,200 --> 01:05:01,700
ということでね、あの…危ないことはね、危ない話はしないで置きまして、あのようね、あの感じで行きたいと思うんですけども、もう本当にオリジナル楽曲はね、フェスやイベント、ソロライブなど、もーほかにもたくさんの思い出が詰まっていて
And so, uh... let's not talk about dangerous things, and I want to go with that kind of feeling, but really, the original songs are packed with so many memories from festivals, events, solo lives, and so much more...

416
01:05:02,314 --> 01:05:07,374
みんながね、たくさん聞いてくれたおかげと言いますか、本当にありがとうございました、と思っています。
I truly believe that it's thanks to everyone listening to me so much... Thank you so much.

417
01:05:09,354 --> 01:05:27,274
ええ、みんなね、あの…この後ですね、あの22時10分から最後の歌ってみたみんなと約束してました、あの動画消えちゃって歌い直そうって言っていたね、あの「キング」を投稿するので絶対見てくださいね！
Um, everyone, um... After this, at 22:10, I promised everyone I'd re-record and post my cover of "King" since the old video disappeared, so please be sure to watch it!

418
01:05:29,334 --> 01:05:38,654
毎日一緒にいてくれたへい民、ホロライブの大好きなメンバーたち、そしてたくさん支えてくださった本当にお世話になった方々全ての方に感謝しています。
I am grateful to all the Heimin who stayed with me every day, my beloved Hololive members, and everyone who supported and cared for me so much.

419
01:05:39,274 --> 01:05:54,774
夢のような時間は本当にありがとうございました。ここに来る前に、子供の頃のアイドルになりたいって夢が、作詞作曲をしてみたいって夢を叶えました。そして、最後の曲ですが、まだ歌うんです！
Thank you so much for this dreamlike time. Coming here, my childhood dream of becoming an idol and my dream of writing and composing songs came true. And as for the final song... I'm still going to sing!

420
01:05:55,534 --> 01:06:12,734
僕が初めて作詞作曲した楽曲があります。今はいない同期、ココの卒業に合わせて4期生の、とわ、ルナのために捧げた楽曲です。前を向いて笑顔でこの楽曲で活動を最後にしたいと思います。それでは聞いてください、「キセキ結び」！
There is a song that I wrote and composed for the very first time. It's a song dedicated to our missing generation-mate Coco, and for Towa and Luna. I want to conclude my activities with a smile, looking forward, with this song. So please listen... "Kiseki Musubi"!

421
01:06:22,332 --> 01:06:26,032
[Title: キセキ結び 作詞・作曲:天音かなた 編曲:ハム]
[Title: Kiseki Musubi Lyrics & Composition: Amane Kanata Arrangement: Ham]

422
01:06:26,452 --> 01:06:37,152
約束しようよ 僕ら出会えたキセキ 忘れないように
Let's make a promise so we'll never forget the miracle of how we met.

423
01:06:47,052 --> 01:06:56,552
夢抱いて集う 青春アニメみたいな ハッピーなエンドになる彼方へ跳ぶよ
Gathering with dreams, like a youth anime—flying toward Kanata for a happy ending!

424
01:06:57,552 --> 01:07:06,552
寝ぼけ目 あくびして 今日は何をしようか 永久に続く海を駆け抜ける
Rubbing sleepy eyes and yawning, what shall we do today? Racing across an endless sea.

425
01:07:07,152 --> 01:07:17,152
今はため息よりも勇気を 諦めるなんてないの ここで歌う 僕の声は聞こえてますか
Now, courage rather than sighs—there's no giving up, singing right here! Can you hear my voice?

426
01:07:19,052 --> 01:07:29,752
きみにとどけ 学校の友達じゃきっとない出会いだった
Reaching out to you—it was an encounter I'd surely never find with school friends.

427
01:07:30,252 --> 01:07:40,052
画面の先の遥か遠くまで ささくれた言葉も 誰かの笑顔になる
Far off beyond the screen, even prickly words will turn into someone's smile.

428
01:07:40,452 --> 01:07:51,452
それぞれの色で 星結ぶキセキ キラキラ輝くステージに 連れてくよ
With our respective colors, the miracle of connecting stars will lead you to a sparkling stage!

429
01:08:00,052 --> 01:08:09,652
泣いて笑ってはしゃいで 毎日ジェットコースター たまには寝転んでおひるねしよう
Crying, laughing, having fun—a daily rollercoaster! Sometimes let's lie down and take a nap.

430
01:08:10,052 --> 01:08:19,852
ちょっと自信ないとき 小鳥とデュエットして 今日だけは泣いちゃうこと許してね
When you're feeling a bit unconfident, duet with a little bird—forgive me for crying just for today.

431
01:08:20,252 --> 01:08:31,152
未来の僕がアルバム開く 傷ついた写真だって宝物だ 僕の愛が見えていますか
The future me opens the album—even wounded photos are treasures. Can you see my love?

432
01:08:36,052 --> 01:08:47,552
きみにとどけ 過去も個性も性格も違うけれど 弱気なときはまぶたぎゅっと瞑り
Reaching out to you—our pasts, individualities, and personalities differ, but when you feel weak, close your eyelids tight.

433
01:08:48,252 --> 01:09:02,052
もう一回 もう一回 絶対に諦めない 前の背中追う へたっぴな僕でも きみの隣に行きたくて 走るの
One more time, one more time, I'll never give up! Chasing the back ahead, even as clumsy as I am, I want to go to your side and run.

434
01:09:04,252 --> 01:09:25,252
誰にも言えずに描いた夢が たとえ叶わないとしても ぼろぼろの靴でも かっこよくなくても 幼いあの日の僕ならなんて言う 止まらないで
Even if the dream I drew without telling anyone doesn't come true, even with tattered shoes, even if I'm not cool... What would my young self from back then say? Don't stop!

435
01:09:26,252 --> 01:09:41,052
初めて僕ら出会った日 まるで昨日みたいに思い出すけど もう行こうか 最後にいま 重なる5人のキセキ
The day we first met—I remember it as if it were yesterday, but let's go now, as the miracle of the five of us finally overlaps right now.

436
01:09:46,452 --> 01:09:59,052
僕の声は聞こえてますか きみにとどけ 黒板のメッセージ 桜のカーテンくぐって 僕らの声を聞いて ずっとずっと
Can you hear my voice? Reaching out to you, a message on the chalkboard, passing through a curtain of cherry blossoms—listen to our voices, forever and ever.

437
01:10:04,300 --> 01:10:06,270
嬉しい日 楽しい日
A happy day, a joyful day,

438
01:10:06,490 --> 01:10:08,960
悲しい日 別れの日も
A sad day, a day of parting,

439
01:10:09,410 --> 01:10:11,710
それぞれの色で
In our respective colors,

440
01:10:11,860 --> 01:10:14,730
星結ぶキセキ
A miracle tying the stars together,

441
01:10:14,860 --> 01:10:18,490
キラキラ輝くステージで
On this sparkling, shining stage,

442
01:10:18,760 --> 01:10:23,450
約束しよう
Let's make a promise...

443
01:10:23,450 --> 01:10:28,450
いつかここで「また会おう」
That we'll meet again here someday.

444
01:10:31,385 --> 01:10:36,385
笑える！ありがとう！これが最高のアイドル！天音かなたでした！
I can laugh! Thank you! I was Kanata, the absolute best idol!

445
01:10:37,385 --> 01:10:40,985
6年間本当に幸せな日々でした！
These past six years truly have been such happy days!

446
01:10:41,485 --> 01:10:44,985
へ民、不器用な僕を応援してくれてありがとう！
Heimin, thank you for supporting clumsy old me!

447
01:10:45,485 --> 01:10:48,985
ずっとずっと大好きだよ！ずっとずっと家族だよ！
I love you so, so much! We're family forever and ever!

448
01:10:49,485 --> 01:10:52,985
みんな本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you all so, so much!

449
01:10:57,985 --> 01:11:01,985
ありがとう！
Thank you!

